<witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T00:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T02:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Continued to P/U and M/U tubingTHRT and landing string. POOH, installed control lines and inspected THRT. RIH and landed off THRT on TH. Observed top box of landing string is too high for casing tong to be able to M/U swedge.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T02:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T02:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to rearrange landing string to be able to M/U swedge w/ casing tong. Started to position upper pup joint of landing string for casing tong to break off. Observed hydraulic oil leak from elevator</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T02:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Identified faulty hydraulic hose inside of the elevator and changed same</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T03:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T05:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke top 6m pup from landing string. M/U swedge using aft PRS and casing tong. Realized that it is not possible to break swedge while connected to TH with THRT. Broke off swedge using aft PRS and casing tong. Located 4m tubing joint (3m + 1m pups) on the pipe deck. M/U same to landing string, M/U 1m pup joint to landing string. Achieved sufficient stick up to be able to M/U swedge</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T05:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T06:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>interruption -- repair</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Attempted to engage THRT to TH. No success, POOH, checked THRT, observed shear pins sheared prematurely. Repaired THRT</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T06:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH and landed off THRT, engaged tool and confirmed w/ 2t overpull. Applied pressure to shear pin and then rotated string 8x turns CCW into communication collar</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T07:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Connected cement hose and LT valve, flushed hose. Pressure tested same to 100 bar. Lined up pumps through cement hose. Applied pressure of 520bar to DHSV control lines. Pressured up well above DHSV, observed DHSV equalized and opened at 100 bar pressure. No indications of gas below DHSV/in the well observed. Bled off pressure from the well through the cement hose to MGS to 0. Closed DHSV. Verified no pressure in the A-annulus</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T08:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T08:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Broke off swedge</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T08:15:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T08:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Released TH and and pulled 180t on hook load. String stretch of 0,75m</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T08:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T08:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Performed Pre-job Meeting to R/U WL equipment</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T08:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T09:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>R/U wireline equipment</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T09:30:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T11:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2616</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>RIH w/ cutter BHA, run #9 from surface 2616 m. Average running speed 20 m/min.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T11:45:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T13:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">2621</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Correlated across interval 2616 -  2638 . Positioned cutter at 2621 m . Performed cut. Observed backflow from pipe after tubing was cut</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2016-10-04T13:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2016-10-04T15:00:00+02:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">0</witsml:md><witsml:phase>fixed</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>plug abandon -- other</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>POOH from 2621 m to surface. Average pulling speed 22 m/min. Backflow at rotary gradually decreased and eventually stopped</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><